---
import { CopyableText } from "@components/ui/copyable-text";

// Combined legal content served by both /privacy and /terms. Kept as a
// component so neither page has to import the other.
---

<div class="min-h-screen bg-dark-navy pt-16">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
      <h1 class="font-nowduke text-4xl sm:text-5xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
        ShellHacks - Privacy Policy &amp; Terms and Conditions
      </h1>

      <div class="bg-navy rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
        <h2 class="font-nowduke text-2xl sm:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
          Privacy Policy
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#FFDC5E] text-sm mt-2">Last Updated: 06/18/2026</p>

        <section class="mt-6">
          <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/80">
            This privacy policy explains how ShellHacks collects, uses, and protects your personal information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-8">
          <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
            1. Information We Collect
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2">
            We collect information that you provide directly to us when registering for ShellHacks, including:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 text-[#E9E7E0]/70 space-y-1">
            <li>Name and contact information</li>
            <li>Educational information</li>
            <li>Resume and professional details</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-8">
          <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
            2. How We Use Your Information
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2">We use the collected data to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 text-[#E9E7E0]/70 space-y-1">
            <li>Provide you access to our services, including our dashboard, our communication platform, and our check-in process</li>
            <li>Send you updates related to ShellHacks</li>
            <li>Communicate with you for internal business purposes, including responding to your inquiries</li>
            <li>Comply with legal obligations and prevent fraudulent activity</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-8">
          <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
            3. Sharing of Your Information
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2">
            We do not sell your personal information. We only share your application/registration information with Major League Hacking for event administration, ranking, and administration (including the creation of linked accounts on MLH and DEV). MLH is bound by their own privacy policy which may be found here:{' '}
            <a
              href="https://www.mlh.com/privacy"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-[#FFDC5E] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#FFDC5E]/80"
            >
              https://www.mlh.com/privacy
            </a>
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-8">
          <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
            4. Your Rights &amp; Choices
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2">
            You have the right to access, update, or delete your personal information. When you submit any Personal Information through our website, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-8">
          <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
            5. Contact Us
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2">
            If you have any questions about this privacy policy or our data practices, please contact us at{' '}
            <CopyableText
              client:load
              value="fiu@weareinit.org"
              className="text-[#FFDC5E] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#FFDC5E]/80"
            />.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-[#E9E7E0]/20 mt-12 pt-12">
          <h2 class="font-nowduke text-2xl sm:text-3xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
            Terms and Conditions
          </h2>
          <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/80 mt-6">
            By participating in ShellHacks 2026, I agree to the following:
          </p>
          <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-4">
            Organizers and Affiliates refers to: All entities of INIT, INIT FIU, ShellHacks, all event organizers, volunteers, judges, and mentors.
          </p>

          <section class="mt-8">
            <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
              Assumption of Risk &amp; Liability Waiver
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2">
              My participation is voluntary and at my sole risk. I assume all risks (including illness, injury, death, or property damage) and release Organizers and Affiliates, and Florida International University, from all liability, claims, or actions arising from my participation or presence at the event, whether due to negligence or otherwise.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="mt-8">
            <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
              Data Sharing &amp; Communication
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2">
              I authorize sharing my resume, email, and LinkedIn with sponsors and MLH, and consent to event-related communications.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="mt-8">
            <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
              Media Release
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2">
              I consent to Organizers and Affiliates recording and using my likeness (That includes photograph and/or video) and voice in any media, worldwide, in perpetuity, for promotional or other lawful purposes, without compensation.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="mt-8">
            <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
              Personal Property
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2">
              I am responsible for my belongings. Organizers and Affiliates (including FIU) are not liable for lost, stolen, or damaged property.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="mt-8">
            <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
              Prizes &amp; Liability
            </h3>
            <div class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2 space-y-4">
              <p>
                Primary prizes are typically sponsor-provided ("Sponsor Prizes"). These Sponsor Prizes are "as-is" without warranty from Organizers and Affiliates and not guaranteed by them. Sponsors are solely responsible for their respective Sponsor Prizes, including fulfillment and any warranties. Organizers and Affiliates (excluding the specific sponsor of a given Sponsor Prize) are not liable for sponsor-related prize issues, unfulfilled Sponsor Prizes, or associated shipping/customs errors. Issues with Sponsor Prizes must be resolved directly with the specific sponsor.
              </p>
              <p>
                Additionally, ShellHacks or other entities within Organizers and Affiliates may, at their discretion, offer their own prizes, such as raffle items or other awards ("Organizer Prizes"). Unless otherwise specified in writing, Organizer Prizes are also provided "as-is" without warranties. The specific entity within Organizers and Affiliates providing an Organizer Prize is responsible for its fulfillment.
              </p>
              <p>
                For all prize types (Sponsor Prizes and Organizer Prizes), winners will be contacted via registration info; no response within 7 days of the initial contact attempt may result in prize forfeiture at the discretion of ShellHacks. Please allow up to 1 month for organizers to contact winners. Organizers and Affiliates are not liable for shipping errors or customs issues affecting prize delivery for any prize type, unless directly caused by their gross negligence.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="mt-8">
            <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
              Discretionary Rights
            </h3>
            <div class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2 space-y-4">
              <p>
                ShellHacks reserves the right to accept, reject, waitlist, or ban any participant at its sole discretion, with or without providing a reason.
              </p>
              <p>
                ShellHacks reserves the right to ask any participant to leave the event at any time if they are found to be in violation of ShellHacks' terms and conditions, Major League Hacking (MLH) policies, or if they are behaving in an uncivil, disruptive, or inappropriate/unprofessional manner.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="mt-8">
            <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
              Code of Conduct
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2">
              I will abide by the MLH Code of Conduct and FIU rules. Violations may lead to disqualification, removal, and prize forfeiture.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="mt-8">
            <h3 class="font-nowduke text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-[#E9E7E0]">
              Severability
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[#E9E7E0]/70 mt-2">
              If any part of these Terms is invalid, the rest remains in effect.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
